## Interface: 30300
## Title: Looty
## Notes: Tracks group loot and master loot rolls in a compact window.
## Author: Ravelo
## Version: 2.1.3
## SavedVariables: Looty_SavedVars

## Load order:
##   1. Libs       — LibStub, LibDeflate (SoftRes dependencies)
##   2. SoftRes    — decoder (references Looty inside functions only)
##   3. Locale     — strings and patterns (no Looty reference)
##   4. Domain     — GroupLoot, MasterLoot (reference Looty inside functions only)
##   5. UI         — Primitives, tab renderers, Frame (same)
##   6. Parser     — chat message routing (same)
##   7. Core       — LAST: creates LootyCore frame, sets global Looty,
##                   registers events. By this point all modules are defined.
##                   No module references Looty at file load time.

Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\LibDeflate\LibDeflate.lua
SoftRes.lua

Locales\enUS.lua

GroupLoot.lua
MasterLoot.lua

UI\Primitives.lua
UI\GroupLootUI.lua
UI\MasterLootUI.lua
UI\OptionsUI.lua
UI\Frame.lua

Parser.lua
Core.lua
